Replaces drivers/nvme/host/apple.c and the t6040 DT sources on e9d2237 with
the files captured from the M1 tree (wallace evidence/2026-10-24-upstream-convergence/
local-source). Not byte-identical to 4f2429104009; covers only these four files.

Signed-off-by: CJ Damsleth <kim@damsleth.no>
